# Purpose: Count and rank endpoint paths from a combined access log.
# Inputs: access.log with request path in whitespace-delimited field seven.
# Outputs: Up to three endpoint,count rows by request volume.
accept access_path as text with default "access.log"
run cat with path access_path
pipe to cut with delimiter " " and fields "7"
pipe to sort
pipe to uniq with flags ["-c"]
pipe to sort with flags ["-rn"]
pipe to head with lines 3
then awk with program "{ $1 = $1; print $1 \",\" $2 }"
